type: dataset
title: "Google Review Rating Resilience Study: 420 Exact-Average Scenarios"
abstract: >-
  An original, reproducible mathematical analysis of the minimum number of
  incoming one-star ratings required to reduce an exact Google review average
  by 0.1, 0.2 or 0.5 points across 20 starting averages and seven review counts.
authors:
  - name: "ReviewsBoost Editorial Team"
